{"text": "biography", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From New Latin <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">biographia</i>, formed from Ancient Greek <i class=\"Polyt mention\" lang=\"grc\">\u03b2\u03af\u03bf\u03c2</i> (b\u00edos, \u201clife\u201d) + <i class=\"Polyt mention\" lang=\"grc\">\u03b3\u03c1\u03ac\u03c6\u03c9</i> (gr\u00e1ph\u014d, \u201cwrite\u201d).\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Noun", "definitions": [{"definition": "A person's life story, especially one published.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {}}, {"definition": "The art of writing this kind of story.", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}, {"pos": "Verb", "definitions": [{"definition": "(transitive) To write a biography of.", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["Received Pronunciation", "/ba\u026a\u02c8\u0252\u0261\u0279\u0259fi/"], ["General American", "/ba\u026a\u02c8\u0251\u0261\u0279\u0259fi/"]]}